ter;\n    }\n    .sub-title-box {\n        background-color: #333;\n        color: white;\n        padding: 4px 16px;\n        border: 1px solid white;\n        border-radius: 20px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"grid-container\">\n\n    <!-- Card 1: CPB -->\n    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">CPB</div>\n        <div class=\"white-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-top\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 110px;\">[CPB产品图]</div>\n                <div class=\"product-info\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">CPB钻石光感隔离<span class=\"product-tag\">《黑长管》</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"product-price\">△540元/36ml</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-spf\">SPF20 PA++</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-specs\">\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">适合：</span>干皮、混干皮</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">功效：</span>保湿抗皱、润色</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">主打滋润抗皱，提亮肤色</span></div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">带一点遮瑕，有润色效果。</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"product-desc\">\n                <p>“干皮必备”款贵妇隔离，主打保湿抗皱，提亮肤色。</p>\n                <p>上脸很细腻，带一点遮瑕，有润色效果，会提亮肤色，还有隐形毛孔的效果，适合干皮，偏干肤质以及中性皮肤。</p>\n                <p>黑色长管滋润款，适合干皮；<br>黑色短管控油款，适合油皮。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 2: 香缇卡 -->\n    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">香缇卡</div>\n        <div class=\"white-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-top\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 110px;\">[香缇卡产品图]</div>\n                <div class=\"product-info\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">香缇卡保湿隔离</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-price\">△760元/50g</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-spf\">SPF15</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-specs\">\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">适合：</span>所有肤质，敏感肌</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">功效：</span>隐形毛孔，润色养肤</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">润色保湿、养肤抗氧化</span></div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">防晒、修饰毛孔，敏感肌可用</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"product-desc\">\n                <p>“伪素颜神器”香缇卡家大火产品，主打隐形毛孔，修饰肤色，有微量润色效果。</p>\n                <p>乳液质地，上脸水润不油腻，有微微润色效果，妆效很自然；同时有养肤、抗氧化的效果。</p>\n                <p>重点是它的成分和质地都非常好，对皮肤没有负担，适合所有肤质，孕妇敏感肌都能用。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 3: YSL -->\n    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">YSL</div>\n        <div class=\"white-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-top\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 110px;\">[YSL产品图]</div>\n                <div class=\"product-info\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">YSL黑丝缎妆前乳</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-price\">△520元/40ml</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-specs\" style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">适合：</span>干皮、混干皮</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">功效：</span>保湿、平滑毛孔</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">主打水润保湿和平滑毛孔，</span></div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">打造水润服帖的水光肌</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"product-desc\">\n                <p>YSL的明星产品兼具护肤和化妆两大功效，它的主打功效就是保湿、平滑毛孔，增加皮肤光泽感~</p>\n                <p>啫喱质地，挤出来是透明肉粉色的，滋润度炒鸡好，用的时候会有水珠爆出来，能够抚平小细纹，后续上妆也更服帖，皮肤光泽度也有很好提升。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 4: 娇兰 -->\n    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">娇兰</div>\n        <div class=\"white-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-top\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\" style=\"width: 35px; height: 100px;\">[娇兰产品图]</div>\n                <div class=\"product-info\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">娇兰金箔妆前乳</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-price\">△580元/30ml</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-specs\" style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">适合：</span>干皮、混干皮</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">功效：</span>保湿提亮</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">添加了金箔微粒，滋润保湿</span></div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">可以抚平小细纹和粗糙。</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"product-desc\">\n                <p>“干皮救星”！主打补水保湿，抚平细纹，可以滋润一整天不干燥。</p>\n                <p>凝露质地，里面含24K金箔微粒，上脸很快会化开~ 金箔是真的黄金悬浮在里面，遇体温啫喱会融化成液态，温和保湿同时抚平小细纹和小粗糙~</p>\n                <p>能让底妆服帖，不卡粉卡纹，适合偏干肤质。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Center Card 5 -->\n    <div class=\"center-title-card\">\n        <div class=\"red-tag\">\n            <span class=\"logo\">RED</span>\n            <span>是青姐啊</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"main-title\">“干皮隔离”</div>\n        <div class=\"sub-titles\">\n            <div class=\"sub-title-box\" style=\"font-size: 22px; padding: 6px 20px;\">8款适合</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-title-box\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">干皮混干皮的</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-title-box\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">好用隔离/妆前</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 6: 怡丽丝尔 -->\n    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">怡丽丝尔</div>\n        <div class=\"white-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-top\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 110px;\">[怡丽丝尔产品图]</div>\n                <div class=\"product-info\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">elixir防晒隔离金管</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-price\">△250元/35g</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-spf\">SPF50+ PA++++</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-specs\">\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">适合：</span>干皮、混干皮</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">功效：</span>美白、防晒、抗皱</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">美白 防晒 隔离三合一，</span></div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">保湿抗皱，不油腻不假白</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"product-desc\">\n                <p>干皮福音！新版SPF50+ PA++++的防护力，日常通勤和户外都能用，足以应对一年四季的紫外线~</p>\n                <p>金管是滋润型的，美白+防晒+隔离三合一，还提升了美容抗皱的效果，添加了“老化酶”成分，可以持续生成角质层细胞。滋润度较高，适合干皮、混干或者秋冬干燥皮肤。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 7: 搪瓷 -->\n    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">搪瓷</div>\n        <div class=\"white-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-top\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 100px;\">[搪瓷产品图]</div>\n                <div class=\"product-info\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">搪瓷高保湿隔离霜</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-price\">△260元/30ml</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-spf\">SPF15</div> \n                    <div class=\"product-specs\">\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">适合：</span>干皮、混干皮</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">功效：</span>保湿、润色</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">粉盖保湿款，主打保湿</span></div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">遮瑕力不错，自带防晒</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"product-desc\">\n                <p>日常必备的伪素颜单品，粉色盖子是基础保湿款。</p>\n                <p>主打保湿和润色，它的保湿润色配方中带有轻微珠光但上脸不明显。</p>\n                <p>质地轻薄细腻，遮瑕力不错，自带防晒，有润色效果，日常裸妆必备了~<br>白盖保湿防晒款适合所有肤质。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 8: Laura mercier -->\n    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">Laura mercier</div>\n        <div class=\"white-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-top\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 100px;\">[LM产品图]</div>\n                <div class=\"product-info\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">Laura mercier隔离</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-price\">△265元/50ml</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-specs\" style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">适合：</span>干皮、混干皮</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">功效：</span>保湿滋润服帖</div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">图片是保湿款，保湿力强</span></div>\n                        <div><span class=\"label\">能够平滑肌肤，帮助锁水</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"product-desc\">\n                <p>很多知名彩妆师的妆前必备单品，主打保湿滋润，服帖底妆。</p>\n                <p>图片这款是保湿款，适合干性皮肤，含8种保湿因子，适合皮肤干燥，上粉底容易起皮和容易脱妆的妹纸。</p>\n                <p>无油款适合油皮、混油皮<br>光采净肤型适合敏感肌痘痘肌。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 9: RMK -->\n    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">RMK</div>\n        <div class=\"white-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-top\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\" style=\"width: 45px; height: 95px;\">[RMK产品图]</div>\n                <div class=\"product-info\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">RMK绢丝隔离妆前乳</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-price\">△320元/30ml</div>\n                 